+BO3 Shader Studio - Export Naming + PostFX Install Cleanup
+=========================================================
+
+Export naming
+-------------
+- Technical authoring names such as floatz_capture and bo3_depth_*_capture no longer become the default name of every exported asset.
+- Generated Beginner HLSL can supply the first authored effect as the friendly default name. Pencil Sketch therefore defaults to pencil_sketch when the current file/project name is only a capture/debug name or the untouched New Screen Effect name.
+- Re-exporting a generated TOOLSGFX/runtime file strips old _ape_<hash>, _toolsgfx, _runtime and _preview suffixes from the suggested Base name.
+- APE cache-busting files use <base>_ape_<hash>.hlsl.
+- Shareable package names default to <base>_bo3.zip.
+- Derived image/sky assets use one de-duplicated prefix/base stem.
+- Explicit Base names typed in the Export dialog are still respected.
+
+PostFX install instructions
+---------------------------
+The full required PostFX activation procedure is now in the main exported instructions:
+- package export: 00_README_FIRST.txt
+- direct install: source_data/<namespace>/<base>_INSTALL_README.txt
+
+Those main instructions include the exact zone lines and the complete generated client CSC code. The separate <base>_POSTFX_INTEGRATION.txt is kept only as a duplicate backup.
+
+The generated script uses persistent PostFX slot 6 and filters::enable_filter_persistent(), preserving the custom Studio filter when temporary BO3 effects use the stock slot-0 path.
